  "question": {
    "text": "Fraunhofer diffraction pattern of a single slit is obtained in the focal plane of the lens of focal length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The third minimum is formed at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math> from the central maximum and the wavelength of light used in the experiment is <math><mn>5000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>. From the given data find the width (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi></math>) of the slit used in the experiment.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "0.3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Using <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math><br /><br />Or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5000</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
